### Listar canchas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canchas

### Crear cancha
POST http://localhost:8080/api/canchas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Cancha 1",
  "deporte": "Futbol 5",
  "precioHora": 15000
}

### Buscar cancha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canchas/1

### Actualizar cancha
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/canchas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Cancha 1 Techada",
  "deporte": "Futbol 5",
  "precioHora": 18000
}

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez",
  "telefono": "2644567890"
}

### Crear reserva
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canchaId": 1,
  "clienteId": 1,
  "inicio": "2026-12-20T18:00:00",
  "horas": 2
}

### Listar reservas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservas

### Buscar reserva
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/1

### Confirmar reserva
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/1/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "CONFIRMADA"
}

### Reservas por cancha y fecha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canchas/1/reservas?fecha=2026-12-20

### Reservas por cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1/reservas

### Probar superposicion de horarios
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canchaId": 1,
  "clienteId": 1,
  "inicio": "2026-12-20T19:00:00",
  "horas": 2
}

### Probar cambio de estado invalido
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservas/1/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "PENDIENTE"
}

### Probar cancha inexistente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canchas/999999

### Probar validacion de horas
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canchaId": 1,
  "clienteId": 1,
  "inicio": "2026-12-20T21:00:00",
  "horas": 5
}
